DML ( Data Manipulation Language ):-
=> It is used to modify data inside a table.
COMMANDS ARE USED:-
1.INSERT 
2.UPDATE
3.DELETE 




1.INSERT:-It is used to insert the values in the table.
SYNTAX:-INSERT INTO table_name (attributes/coulmn names) VALUES (     );


2.UPDATE:-It is used to modify the table.
SYNTAX:- UPDATE table_name SET column_name = new_value WHERE condition;


3.DELETE:- It is used to delete only one record which record we want. 
SYNTAX:-DELETE FROM table_name WHERE condition;







